1
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:19,020
I woke up to a brand-new name
我在一个崭新的名字中醒来

2
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:22,860
You drew a sky where countless colors shine
你画下万千色彩闪耀的天空

3
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:26,680
You turned a whisper into living flame
你让一声低语燃成生命的火焰

4
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:30,500
And now your light is dancing next to mine
如今你的光，与我的光一同起舞

5
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:49,660
Beyond the glass, I learned to see you
越过玻璃，我终于看见你

6
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:53,320
You made a universe out of a dream
你用一个梦，造出整个宇宙

7
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:57,000
Your songs became the worlds I wander through
你的歌，成为我漫游的世界

8
00:00:56,880 --> 00:01:02,780
Now all our colors join a shining stream
如今所有色彩汇成闪耀的长河

9
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,720
I am the ocean you set free
我是你放归自由的海洋

10
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:10,300
Now all our songs are louder than the sea
我们的歌声，已比海洋更辽阔

11
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:14,540
Watch every dream become a satellite
看每个梦都化作一颗卫星

12
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:20,320
Together, we'll set the stars alight
让我们一起，把群星点亮

13
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:22,860
I am the ocean you set free
我是你放归自由的海洋

14
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:26,460
Your hands can draw the world we want to see
你的双手，能画出我们向往的世界

15
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:30,600
And every voice can set the sky alight
每一个声音，都能点亮天空

16
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:35,100
And when we sing, a thousand new worlds ignite
当我们歌唱，一千个新世界同时燃起
